Value ACTION (permit|deny)
Value PROTOCOL (\S+)
Value SOURCE (any|host\s+\S+|\S+\s+\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value DEST (any|host\s+\S+|\S+\s+\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value PORT (\d+)

Start
  ^\s*${ACTION}\s+${PROTOCOL}\s+${SOURCE}\s+${DEST}\s+eq\s+${PORT}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*${ACTION}\s+${PROTOCOL}\s+${SOURCE}\s+${DEST}\s*$$ -> Record
